  "adaptation": "Original 20 method bodies and decorators unchanged; custom minimal initializer. Business SessionCompactor uses UUID output filenames and registers transcript paths outside vendor. Project prepare transactionally applies the original latest tool-result batch budget, then snip, micro, fit and opt-in automatic summary. Harness integrates opt-in explicit compact after complete tool batches and recognized-overflow reactive recovery. All summary paths share one attempt per user turn. Failed budget staging preserves original messages/registry and stops. Failed summary candidates preserve history; reactive permits one extra main request without repeating tools. Business guards, controlled file lookup and events live outside vendor; upstream remains unchanged.",
